{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2023-02-01 08:07:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE ELECTS MONICA TURNER TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NORTHBROOK, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE ALLSTATE CORPORATION (NYSE: ALL) ANNOUNCED THAT MONICA TURNER, 57, PRESIDENT, NORTH AMERICA, AT PROCTER & GAMBLE (NYSE: PG), HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ALLSTATE'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE FEB. 1. AS OF THAT DATE, ALLSTATE'S BOARD WILL HAVE 12 DIRECTORS."}